I
1200 Version - HAND-WRITTEN FIXTURE. Every value below is invented.
# ZOXOL appears TWICE on purpose: once enroute (ENRT) and once scoped to ZZZZ.
# Collapsing that terminal column would make roughly half the legs of a typical
# SID unresolvable, so the two must stay distinguishable.
# The last record is deliberately malformed: it must be skipped and counted,
# never fatal.

  40.50000000   -3.50000000 ZOXOL ENRT LE 4530011
  40.20000000   -3.20000000 ZOXOL ZZZZ LE 4530011
  40.60000000   -3.60000000 ZANKO ENRT LE 4530011
  40.30000000   -2.70000000 ZUBIX ZZZZ LE 4530011
  41.10000000   -3.10000000 ZEBRA ENRT LE 4530011
  not-a-latitude -3.00000000 ZBROK ENRT LE 4530011
99
